<section
  class="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel"
  aria-labelledby="album-visibility-heading"
>
  <div class="section-heading flex items-start justify-between gap-4.5 border-b border-[#d8e0e2] px-6 pt-5.75 pb-4.5 max-mobile:flex-wrap max-mobile:px-4.25 max-mobile:pt-5 max-mobile:pb-3.75">
    <div>
      <h2 id="album-visibility-heading">Album visibility</h2>
      <p>Choose which approved conversations appear in the album.</p>
    </div>
    <p
      class="album-visibility-count pt-1 text-right text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[.08em] text-muted max-mobile:w-full max-mobile:text-left"
      id="album-visibility-count"
    >
      Loading approvals…
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="px-6 py-5 max-mobile:px-4.25 max-mobile:py-4">
    <p class="mb-4 max-w-[78ch] text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted" id="album-visibility-help">
      Hiding a conversation does not revoke its opt-in or delete saved images. New approvals stay
      visible by default. Saved changes apply to the next album request; an already-open album may
      need a reload.
    </p>

    <fieldset
      class="min-w-0 border-0 p-0"
      id="album-visibility-fieldset"
      aria-describedby="album-visibility-help"
      disabled
    >
      <legend class="sr-only">Choose which approved conversations appear in the album</legend>
      <div class="grid gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2" id="album-visibility-list"></div>
    </fieldset>

    <div
      class="rounded-md border border-[#d8e0e2] bg-[#f3f6f6] px-4 py-5 text-sm text-[#435963]"
      id="album-visibility-empty"
      hidden
    >
      <h3 class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold">No approved conversations yet</h3>
      <p class="m-0 text-xs leading-relaxed">
        Conversations will appear here after they opt in, even before their first image is saved.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 border-t border-[#d8e0e2] pt-4 max-mobile:items-stretch">
      <p
        class="album-visibility-feedback min-h-5 flex-1 text-xs text-muted max-mobile:basis-full"
        id="album-visibility-feedback"
        role="status"
        aria-live="polite"
        aria-atomic="true"
        data-state="loading"
      >
        Loading saved visibility…
      </p>
      <button
        class="button button-secondary inline-flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-[7px] border border-[#a8bac1] bg-[#f3f7f7] px-4 py-2.75 text-center text-sm font-[680] text-[#163746] transition-[background-color,border-color,transform] duration-140 hover:bg-[#eaf1f2] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-[.52] motion-reduce:transition-none"
        id="album-visibility-reload"
        type="button"
        hidden
      >
        Reload saved settings
      </button>
      <button
        class="button button-primary inline-flex min-h-11 min-w-36 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-[7px] border border-transparent bg-brand px-4 py-2.75 text-center text-sm font-[680] text-white transition-[background-color,border-color,transform] duration-140 hover:bg-brand-hover disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-[.52] motion-reduce:transition-none"
        id="album-visibility-save"
        type="button"
        disabled
      >
        Save visibility
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
